      value: 1.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Huh... I was just checking inventory, and we seem to be missing a few
        sausage links.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: The pack of them was open when I got here, and apparently the expiration
        date was yesterday.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: I don't know who would've stolen a few sausage links. This is a cannery,
        after all; they could've just asked.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Actually, I think I should be a bit more worried about the sausage links
        going bad. For starters, we'll have to throw this away.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Anyway, I sure hope whoever ate the sausage links doesn't get food poisoning.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: movementPattern.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: timeBetweenPattern.Array.size
